      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T12:18:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this makes sense, but I believe we should encourage disclosing AI-assisted contributions. Other Google projects do that [1]. If we don\u0027t want to explicitly mention the tool, we can just add a generic git trailer `Assisted-By: AI` or any other way of making it clear.\n\nWe could ask to add it only if the AI-generated content was \"substantial\".\n\n[1]: https://github.com/google/gvisor/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#label-ai-assisted-work",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 127,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "d936dee47d0f001cea35abca1c9e5ba78a76d543",
